    <item>
      <title>使用 GAMMA AI 修正 7 個常犯的簡報錯誤！</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 19 Jul 2023 13:42:18 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>AI 實戰</category>
      <description>簡報就是「簡單的報告」，這篇文章的目標不是帶大家做出華麗的簡報，而是在短時間透過 GAMMA AI 修正錯誤，做出能清晰表達自己觀點、有良好閱讀體驗的簡報。</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-og_hu_a24535cd64f09413.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="675" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>簡報就是「簡單的報告」，這篇文章的目標不是帶大家做出華麗的簡報，而是在短時間透過 <a href="https://try.gamma.app/h0c9z09kpqu3">GAMMA AI</a> 修正錯誤，做出能清晰表達自己觀點、有良好閱讀體驗的簡報。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-01.webp" width="1019" height="567" alt="使用 GAMMA AI 修正 7 個常犯的簡報錯誤！（圖 1）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></p>
<blockquote>
<p>第一次聽到 GAMMA AI 的朋友，可以<a href="https://deanlin.net/blog/202306/gamma-ai-presentations/">先透過這篇文章</a>了解他有多強大！</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 class="h-nomark" id="1-文字太多找不到重點">1. 文字太多找不到重點<a class="h-anchor" href="#1-%e6%96%87%e5%ad%97%e5%a4%aa%e5%a4%9a%e6%89%be%e4%b8%8d%e5%88%b0%e9%87%8d%e9%bb%9e" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>筆者最常看到的錯誤，就是簡報上密密麻麻一堆字，然後主講者把它當逐字稿在念；基本上這種簡報只會成為催眠曲，台下觀眾無論是「聽」還是「看」都很痛苦。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-02.webp" width="1400" height="725" alt="1. 文字太多找不到重點（圖 2）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>這邊我透過「Visualize key points」的方式抓出想表達的「重點」。</p>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-03.webp" width="1400" height="745" alt="1. 文字太多找不到重點（圖 3）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-04.webp" width="1400" height="745" alt="1. 文字太多找不到重點（圖 4）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>


</div>

<p>儘管重點已經呈現，但字數還是太多；所以使用「Condense text」簡化內容。</p>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-05.webp" width="1400" height="834" alt="1. 文字太多找不到重點（圖 5）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-06.webp" width="1400" height="834" alt="1. 文字太多找不到重點（圖 6）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>


</div>

<p>如果不喜歡 AI 提供的方案，你也可以套用自己喜歡的模板（Templates）。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-07.webp" width="1400" height="673" alt="1. 文字太多找不到重點（圖 7）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 class="h-nomark" id="2-列點太多導致重點混亂">2. 列點太多導致重點混亂<a class="h-anchor" href="#2-%e5%88%97%e9%bb%9e%e5%a4%aa%e5%a4%9a%e5%b0%8e%e8%87%b4%e9%87%8d%e9%bb%9e%e6%b7%b7%e4%ba%82" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>有時我們會用列點的方式呈現內容，但過多的子母項會增加觀眾的理解成本。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-08.webp" width="1400" height="876" alt="2. 列點太多導致重點混亂（圖 8）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>我們可以先將它拆分成幾張簡報</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-09.webp" width="1368" height="1450" alt="2. 列點太多導致重點混亂（圖 9）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>拆分後可能覺得視覺太過單調，此時可以將它轉為圖片搭配文字的外觀（Images with text layout）。</p>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-10.webp" width="1400" height="757" alt="2. 列點太多導致重點混亂（圖 10）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-11.webp" width="1400" height="757" alt="2. 列點太多導致重點混亂（圖 11）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>


</div>

<hr>
<h2 class="h-nomark" id="3-文字太小閱讀體驗差">3. 文字太小閱讀體驗差<a class="h-anchor" href="#3-%e6%96%87%e5%ad%97%e5%a4%aa%e5%b0%8f%e9%96%b1%e8%ae%80%e9%ab%94%e9%a9%97%e5%b7%ae" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>前面兩點已經向大家說明造成文字太小的主因</p>
<ul>
<li>在一張簡報中塞太多字</li>
<li>列點太長導致</li>
</ul>
<p>不過還有一種可能是簡報都採用默認字型大小（ex：12 px）所導致，所呈現的畫面可能長這樣：</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-12.webp" width="1400" height="620" alt="3. 文字太小閱讀體驗差（圖 12）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>看起來很不舒服吧？如果真的只想呈現文字，請調整大小保證他的閱讀體驗。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-13.webp" width="1400" height="620" alt="3. 文字太小閱讀體驗差（圖 13）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 class="h-nomark" id="4-內容與標題比例錯誤">4. 內容與標題比例錯誤<a class="h-anchor" href="#4-%e5%85%a7%e5%ae%b9%e8%88%87%e6%a8%99%e9%a1%8c%e6%af%94%e4%be%8b%e9%8c%af%e8%aa%a4" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>這邊就用不久前<a href="https://tw.stock.yahoo.com/news/%E8%89%BE%E6%80%A1%E8%89%AF%E9%87%91%E6%9B%B2%E6%90%9E%E7%83%8F%E9%BE%8D-%E9%A0%92%E7%8D%8E%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%87-%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89-%E7%B6%B2-%E7%9C%8B%E5%82%BB%E7%9C%BC-001600395.html">金曲獎搞烏龍</a>的卡片來當範例</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-14.webp" width="960" height="640" alt="Temateli Kao IG" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>Temateli Kao IG</figcaption>
</figure>

<p>因為評審右下角的簽名太大，導致閱讀者第一眼會誤以為得獎者是右下角的名字；簡報設計也是一樣的，我們的視覺會被「大」的文字所吸引。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-15.webp" width="1400" height="620" alt="4. 內容與標題比例錯誤（圖 15）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>在標題很大，內容很小的狀況下，我們注意力會被標題吸引過去；但有時內容才是主體，我們可以調整一下兩者比例來維持觀眾的注意力。</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-16.webp" width="1400" height="656" alt="使用「Bullets」來呈現" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>使用「Bullets」來呈現</figcaption>
</figure>

<hr>
<h2 class="h-nomark" id="5-留白太多視覺不均衡">5. 留白太多視覺不均衡<a class="h-anchor" href="#5-%e7%95%99%e7%99%bd%e5%a4%aa%e5%a4%9a%e8%a6%96%e8%a6%ba%e4%b8%8d%e5%9d%87%e8%a1%a1" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>如果某張簡報你只想放一段話，那在留白太多的狀況下會看起來很怪異。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-17.webp" width="1400" height="656" alt="5. 留白太多視覺不均衡（圖 17）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>但如果搭配一張圖片，畫面就會協調很多。</p>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-18.webp" width="1400" height="832" alt="5. 留白太多視覺不均衡（圖 18）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-19.webp" width="1400" height="916" alt="GAMMA 可以在使用時搜尋圖片，或透過 AI 推薦圖片給你" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>GAMMA 可以在使用時搜尋圖片，或透過 AI 推薦圖片給你</figcaption>
</figure>


</div>

<hr>
<h2 class="h-nomark" id="6-簡報風格不一致">6. 簡報風格不一致<a class="h-anchor" href="#6-%e7%b0%a1%e5%a0%b1%e9%a2%a8%e6%a0%bc%e4%b8%8d%e4%b8%80%e8%87%b4" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>雖然聽起來有點不可思議，但筆者看過有些人的簡報前後風格並不一致，就像是下面呈現的這樣。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-20.webp" width="1386" height="1502" alt="6. 簡報風格不一致（圖 20）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>通常會有這個問題，原因來自這份簡報是用多個簡報拼貼而成，但講者根本沒有去統一風格所導致；如果你不知如何設計簡報，直接選用預設的模板其實就已經有不錯的效果。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-21.webp" width="1400" height="703" alt="6. 簡報風格不一致（圖 21）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 class="h-nomark" id="7-簡報底色不適合播放場地">7. 簡報底色不適合播放場地<a class="h-anchor" href="#7-%e7%b0%a1%e5%a0%b1%e5%ba%95%e8%89%b2%e4%b8%8d%e9%81%a9%e5%90%88%e6%92%ad%e6%94%be%e5%a0%b4%e5%9c%b0" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>這點真的是經過實戰才會發現的問題。</p>
<p>如果你在明亮、較小的場地，那預設的白色背景簡報沒有問題；但如果在大演講廳，為了避免投影幕反光，通常會將室內燈光調暗，這會導致後方的觀眾較難看清簡報內容。</p>
<div class="gallery-row cols-2">

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-22.webp" width="1400" height="766" alt="7. 簡報底色不適合播放場地（圖 22）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-23.webp" width="1400" height="766" alt="7. 簡報底色不適合播放場地（圖 23）" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</figure>


</div>

<p>此時可以依據場地即時變換主題（Theme）的功能就非常重要，讓你寫一份簡報就能在多個場合使用！</p>
<hr>
<p>對用 AI 產生簡報有興趣的朋友，可以使用筆者的連結註冊喔：</p>
<p><a href="https://try.gamma.app/h0c9z09kpqu3">https://try.gamma.app/h0c9z09kpqu3</a></p>
<hr>
